          "expected": "FRT-201 Bưởi Diễn (fruit) 59000 đ, stock 30\nDRY-310 Gạo ST25 (5 kg) (dry) 180000 đ, stock 15\nVEG-110 Nấm hương khô (dry) 89000 đ, stock 8\nchanged 2, originals intact\nstock: vegetables 0, fruit 30, meat 0, dairy 0, dry 23",
          "hidden": false,
